{"id":"menton","lemma":"menton","pos":"noun","rank":4122,"glosses":["chin"],"ipa":"/mɑ̃.tɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/Fr-menton.ogg/Fr-menton.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"mentons"},"formAudio":{"mentons":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-mentons.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je l'ai frappé au menton.","en":"I hit him on the chin.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"beaten, hit"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Tom a une fossette sur son menton.","en":"Tom has a dimple on his chin.","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dimple"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Comment t'es-tu fait cette cicatrice sur le menton ?","en":"How did you get that scar on your chin?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"scar"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous mentons tous.","en":"We all lie.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"all"}]},{"text":"À son menton, on peut voir qu'il ressemble à son père.","en":"You can see from his chin that takes after his father.","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to resemble","l":"ressembler"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"father"}]}]}